  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3524,
      "text": "We will certainly make them taste some minor punishment[7] prior to the greater punishment[8], so that they may return.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 417,
      "ruku": 359,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3525,
      "text": "Who does greater wrong than one who is reminded of the verses of his Lord, then turns away from them? We will surely take vengeance upon the wicked.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 417,
      "ruku": 359,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3526,
      "text": "We gave Moses the Scripture, so do not doubt about meeting him[9], and We made it a guide for the Children of Israel.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 417,
      "ruku": 360,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3527,
      "text": "We made some of them leaders[10], guiding by Our command, because they observed patience and firmly believed in Our signs.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 417,
      "ruku": 360,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3528,
      "text": "Indeed, it is your Lord Who will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which they used to differ.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 417,
      "ruku": 360,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3529,
      "text": "Is it not yet clear to them how many generations We destroyed before them, in whose dwellings they now walk about? Indeed, there are signs in this. Do they not then listen?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 417,
      "ruku": 360,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3530,
      "text": "Do they not see that We drive water to parched land, producing thereby crops of which their cattle and they themselves eat? Do they not then see?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 417,
      "ruku": 360,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3531,
      "text": "They say, “When will this Decision[11] be if you are truthful?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 417,
      "ruku": 360,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3532,
      "text": "Say, “On the Day of Decision the belief of those who disbelieved will not benefit them, nor will they be given any respite.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 417,
      "ruku": 360,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3533,
      "text": "So turn away from them and wait; they too are waiting.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
